1D453\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> will have less freezing point \n<br><br>and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.667ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.274ex\" height=\"2.287ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 1888.9 1011\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(833,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D447\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D447\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(617,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> will be more when value of i is more.\n<br><br>Now, for,\n<br><br>[ Co (H<sub>2</sub>O)<sub>6</sub>] Cl<sub>3</sub> <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.032ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.262ex\" height=\"1.195ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -514 1000 528\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"21CC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-V-21CC\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> [ Co(H<sub>2</sub>O)<sub>6</sub>]<sup>3+</sup> + 3Cl<sup><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.505ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -583 778 665\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></sup>\n<br><br>Value of i = 4 (no. of ions), 3 ions of Cl<sup><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.505ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -583 778 665\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></sup> \n<br><br>and one ion of [ Co (H<sub>2</sub>O)<sub>6</sub>]<sup>3+</sup> \n<br><br>[ Co (H<sub>2</sub>O)<sub>5</sub> Cl ] Cl<sub>2</sub> . H<sub>2</sub>O <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.032ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.262ex\" height=\"1.195ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -514 1000 528\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"21CC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-V-21CC\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> [ Co (H<sub>2</sub>O)<sub>5</sub> Cl ]<sup>2+</sup> + 2Cl<sup><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.505ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -583 778 665\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></sup> \n<br><br>Value of i = 3\n<br><br>[ Co (H<sub>2</sub>O)<sub>4</sub> Cl<sub>2</sub> ] Cl . 2H<sub>2</sub>O <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.032ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.262ex\" height=\"1.195ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -514 1000 528\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"21CC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-V-21CC\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> [ Co (H<sub>2</sub>O)<sub>4</sub> Cl<sub>2</sub> ] <sup>+</sup> + Cl<sup><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.505ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -583 778 665\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></sup>\n<br><br>Value of i = 2\n<br><br>and  [ Co(H<sub>2</sub>O)<sub>3</sub> Cl ] . 3H<sub>2</sub>O  do not show ionization.\n<br><br>So, i = 1.\n<br><br>As, [ Co (H<sub>2</sub>O)<sub>3</sub> Cl ]. 3H<sub>2</sub>O have lowest value of i, \n<br><br>So, it's freezing point will be maximum."
